+"grayscale\">Gråskala</link>, <link linkend=\"gimp-filter-desaturate\">"
+"Avmätta</link>, <link linkend=\"plug-in-decompose-registered\">Dela upp</"
+"link> eller <link linkend=\"gimp-filter-channel-mixer\">Kanalblandare</"
